oc-omniroute-plugin
===================

This package is an independent community derivative of the MIT-licensed
OmniRoute OpenCode V2 plugin:

    @omniroute/opencode-plugin-v2
    https://github.com/diegosouzapw/OmniRoute
    Copyright (c) 2026 OmniRoute contributors
    MIT License

Substantial portions of src/ and tests/ originate from that project. They are
used and modified under the terms of the MIT License reproduced in LICENSE.

This project is NOT an official OmniRoute package and is NOT endorsed by or
affiliated with OmniRoute or OpenCode. It is maintained independently.

Changes from upstream include, among others:
  - normalized custom-provider identity (displayPrefix, provider-specific
    prefixes, canonical node ids) shared by enrichment, filtering and naming;
  - name-first model titles with a provider marker;
  - a single-credential configuration;
  - opt-in OmniRoute-backed web search and webfetch over REST, without MCP.
